Atomic number.

Electron configuration.

Number of electron shells.

Number of valence electrons.

A simplified Bohr model.

The relationship between valence electrons and ion formation.

Use these shell distributions for neutral atoms:

Na: 2, 8, 1.

Cl: 2, 8, 7.

Mg: 2, 8, 2.

O: 2, 6.

Ca: 2, 8, 8, 2.

F: 2, 7.

K: 2, 8, 8, 1.

